From b17cdce00feea3e6f6385b937af5233c50c8493c Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: ajensenwaud <ajensenwaud@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Wed, 4 Nov 2026 21:45:53 +1100
Subject: [PATCH 26/26] ling: kept prompt states on disk
 (--learn-conversations, --spill-gib) through main's rows store: one image in
 rank 0's store holding every rank's KDA parts, the MTP layer's rows and each
 MLA layer's rows by position from the rank holding them (split or not); rank
 1's share moves over NCCL in blank/disk_out/disk_in steps; a state read back
 restores as a copy, settled in place past the native window; the CUDA disk
 open takes a family's host staging permit (Ling: 4 GiB, 2 GiB past the native
 window); test-ling registered through cuda_engines.lingHost and the runner's
 ling_cuda import in the family list, so zig/build/cuda.zig stays at 600 lines

